CarPlay's UI size is the stream's physical width in millimetres (2026-10-22).

CarPlay lays out by the physical size it is told, not by pixels: at 200 mm, 1280x720 and 2560x1440 at
every old UI-scale canvas showed the same two rows of five icons (checked on a box, 2026-10-22). The
size setting now picks the stream's long side: 200/250/300/350 mm for 115/100/85/75, so saved values
carry over; a portrait screen takes it on the long side too, so icons keep their size when the screen
turns. CarPlayUiScale.apply (a larger canvas) is no longer used. The settings page offers "Smaller".

